- Damai Dai et al. _DeepSeekMoE: Towards Ultimate Expert Specialization in Mixture-of-Experts Language Models_. [arXiv:2401.06066](https://arxiv.org/abs/2401.06066), 2024.
- Lean Wang, Huazuo Gao, Chenggang Zhao, Xu Sun, Damai Dai. _Auxiliary-Loss-Free Load Balancing Strategy for Mixture-of-Experts_. [arXiv:2408.15664](https://arxiv.org/abs/2408.15664), 2024.
